The Vulkan half of 0120/0121 for the host render target path (GPUs without fragment shader interlock):
a rectangle-list draw that fully overwrites a render target skips the transfer of its previous contents
inside the overwritten rectangle. Vulkan render targets start undefined, so the stencil of a depth-only
overwrite is always transferred whole and 0121's stencil bit tracking has nothing to save here.

